index 76c26dc..04aef12 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Fixed: a payment larger than the balance was taken and left the member in credit; it is now refused (`overpayment`).
 - `lend cancel-hold CARD TITLE` cancels a hold; a copy already set aside goes to the next member waiting.
 - A loan cannot be renewed while another member has a hold waiting on the title (`holds_waiting`).
 - The loans ledger writes each fine on a `fine` line of its own after the return; new ledgers start `#lending-ledger v2`, and v1 ledgers are still read.
